<title>USA: Digital Biometrics gets Chicago contract.</title>
<headline>Digital Biometrics gets Chicago contract.</headline>
<dateline>MINNETONKA, Minn. 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Digital Biometrics Inc said Tuesday it won a contract from the City of Chicago valued at about $1.3 million to install live-scan systems and related equipment for the Chicago Police Department.</p>
<p>Digital Biometrics manufactures and markets identification systems.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
